WEBVTT

00:11:29.428 --> 00:11:30.880
And as you said,

00:11:30.904 --> 00:11:34.666
language learning will become
something more cultural.

00:11:34.994 --> 00:11:38.042
The reason you want to learn
another language,

00:11:38.066 --> 00:11:40.193
let's say Spanish or Chinese,

00:11:40.217 --> 00:11:43.592
would be closer to the reason
you want to learn Latin now.

00:11:43.616 --> 00:11:46.117
It's to appreciate the classics,

00:11:46.141 --> 00:11:51.779
and to be able to directly take in
the foreign language and understand it.

00:11:51.803 --> 00:11:55.366
It wouldn't be for using it as a tourist,

00:11:55.390 --> 00:11:59.779
or using it to trade
or contract negotiation.

00:11:59.803 --> 00:12:03.247
So the casual uses
will be no longer that useful.